#: ../../trades.md:22 7f5fcade135947f794934c1c4b985226
msgid "Basket and spread are in the schema and are not built. The interface never offers them. **Digital** is on that list for a different reason: a knock digital is a barrier carrying a binary payoff, and that trade prices — see below."
msgstr "一籃子與價差選擇權存在於結構描述中，但沒有實作。介面從不提供它們。**二元**在那份清單上的理由不同：敲出入二元選擇權就是帶著二元收益函數的障礙選擇權，而那筆交易是計得出價的——見下文。"

#: ../../trades.md:27 716103525d4f4f9db7d68b455a436e6e
msgid "The style card with cliquet selected: the style picker, a reset-dates box, a ratchet-or-performance switch with no default, and a paragraph explaining that caps and floors are not offered."
msgstr "選了棘輪式之後的類型卡片：類型選單、重設日輸入框、沒有預設值的「棘輪型／表現型」切換，以及一段說明為何不提供上下限的文字。"

#: ../../trades.md:31 dddf9a6448e8492d97d5d1b8cc6dd9ac
msgid "The style card, on the one style that also explains a refusal. Picking a style swaps the block underneath it — a barrier gets a level and a rebate, a chooser a choice date and a put leg, this one its reset dates. **Performance** is a Flag with no default because it chooses the engine rather than scaling the price, and the sentence at the bottom stands where the cap and floor fields would have been."
msgstr "類型卡片，示範的是唯一一個還要順便解釋拒絕理由的類型。選定一個類型，就會把它底下那一整塊換掉——障礙有障礙水準與回饋金，選擇者有選擇日與賣權腳，這個則是它的重設日。**performance** 是一個沒有預設值的 Flag，因為它選的是引擎而不是把價格縮放；而最底下那句話，就站在上下限欄位原本會出現的位置。"

#: ../../trades.md:39 b07ea6fa52e54be2a3b2b00bfb1a0ae4
msgid "The rules worth knowing before you author one"
msgstr "編寫之前值得知道的規則"

#: ../../trades.md:41 7d2dfed1368b431c8ae62814d2a7a560
msgid "**Barrier.** The analytic engine is European only; an American barrier goes to the lattice or the FD grid. The barrier lattice is **Cox-Ross-Rubinstein only** (with the Derman-Kani correction), because the engine takes a second template argument for the discretisation and a full menu would be trees × discretisations. Discrete and partial-time barriers — monitoring dates, a window start — are not built."
msgstr "**障礙。**解析解引擎僅限歐式；美式障礙要走格點或有限差分網格。障礙格點**僅支援 Cox-Ross-Rubinstein**（含 Derman-Kani 修正），因為該引擎的第二個樣板參數是離散化方式，完整選單會變成樹 × 離散化。離散觀察與部分期間障礙——觀察日、起算窗口——沒有實作。"

#: ../../trades.md:48 aad20efdbdfc4832876fda4ba4cf202b
msgid "**Knock digital.** Choose **barrier**, then a cash-or-nothing or asset-or-nothing payoff. QuantLib has no digital-knock instrument — that shape *is* the product, and the schema's `digital` style re-declares the barrier type, the level and the cash payoff it already carries. It prices analytically on an American exercise settled at expiry, and it takes **no rebate**: the engine never reads one, so a rebate would be taken and dropped rather than refused."
msgstr "**敲出入二元選擇權。**先選 **障礙**，再選現金或零、資產或零的收益函數。QuantLib 裡沒有「二元敲出入」這個商品類別——這個組合*就是*那個商品，而結構描述裡的 `digital` 類型只是把障礙型態、障礙水準與現金給付再宣告一次，這些欄位請求本來就帶著了。它以解析解計價，履約方式是美式且在到期日結算，而且**不接受回饋金**：引擎根本不會讀它，所以送進來的回饋金會被收下並丟棄，而不是被拒絕。"

#: ../../trades.md:55 cc04756b77674710b94a054ff8f6cee0
msgid "**Double barrier.** Needs $0 < H_{\\text{lower}} < H_{\\text{upper}}$, and analytic only: QuantLib's sole FD double-barrier engine is Heston, which takes a calibrated model rather than a process."
msgstr "**雙障礙。**需要 $0 < H_{\\text{lower}} < H_{\\text{upper}}$，且僅有解析解：QuantLib 唯一的有限差分雙障礙引擎是 Heston，它吃的是校準過的模型而不是隨機過程。"

#: ../../trades.md:59 66f15bd14024438a9d45abe7f07011ce
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Forward start.** Send no strike. The strike is *moneyness* × the spot at the reset date, filled in by the engine, and a struck payoff would be silently overwritten. The **performance** flag pays the return rather than the amount — a different price for the same trade description ({doc}`maths/exotics`)."
msgstr "**遠期起始。**不要送履約價。履約價是*價內程度*乘上重設日的現貨價，由引擎自行填入，若送了帶履約價的收益函數會被無聲覆寫。**performance** 旗標支付的是報酬率而非金額——同一段交易描述，不同的價格（{doc}`maths/exotics`）。"

#: ../../trades.md:64 0681ac14592a4b78945de2fdedea1ca4
msgid "**Asian.** No fixing dates means continuously averaged, which has a closed form for the **geometric** average only. With fixing dates, geometric goes to the analytic engine and arithmetic to Monte Carlo."
msgstr "**亞式。**沒有定盤日代表連續平均，而連續平均只有**幾何**平均才有封閉解。有定盤日時，幾何平均走解析解引擎，算術平均走蒙地卡羅。"

#: ../../trades.md:68 d83c9c1057184f1ea47d44ab74524010
msgid "**Lookback.** Continuous only. The running extremum is required and must be positive: an option already running whose extremum is dropped would price as if it had just started. A floating payoff selects the floating-strike instrument."
msgstr "**回顧式。**僅限連續觀察。累積極值為必填且必須為正：一個已經在存續中、卻漏掉極值的選擇權，會被當成剛剛才開始那樣計價。浮動收益函數會選到浮動履約價的商品。"

#: ../../trades.md:72 9a1e665e1291411ab3b6fc14a934e804
msgid "**Compound.** An option on an option, and the only trade here with a second payoff and exercise inside it. The compound's own — the *mother* — are the trade's payoff and exercise, authored where every other style takes them; the style block holds only the option written on. The schema's `Compound.mother_payoff` and `mother_exercise` are those same two fields a second time, and the service refuses them by name rather than choosing which copy wins. Both legs are plain and European, and the compound has to expire on or before the option it is written on."
msgstr "**複合式。**選擇權上的選擇權，也是這裡唯一在內部還帶著第二組收益函數與履約的交易。複合式自己的那一組——也就是*母*選擇權——就是這筆交易的收益函數與履約，寫在其他每一種類型都用的地方；類型區塊裡只放它所寫在其上的那個選擇權。結構描述中的 `Compound.mother_payoff` 與 `mother_exercise` 是同樣那兩個欄位再來一次，服務會指名拒絕它們，而不是自行決定哪一份算數。兩腳都是一般型收益函數與歐式履約，而且複合式的到期日必須不晚於它所寫在其上的那個選擇權。"

#: ../../trades.md:81 492db8bf25664f129ebc815e2d732ee2
msgid "**Chooser.** The right to decide later whether this is a call or a put, and `choice date` is when. There is no call or put to author: both chooser instruments build their own plain payoff and overwrite the type, so the payoff type is left unset and the service refuses one that is set. The strike and the expiry are the trade's own payoff and exercise, for the same reason the compound's mother is; `Chooser.call_strike` and `call_expiry` in the schema are those fields a second time and are refused by name."
msgstr "**選擇者。**日後才決定這是買權還是賣權的權利，而 `choice date`（選擇日）就是決定的時點。這裡沒有買權賣權可填：兩種選擇者商品都會自己建一個一般型收益函數並覆寫型態，所以收益函數的型態留空不填，送了型態進來服務會拒絕。履約價與到期日就是這筆交易自己的收益函數與履約，理由和複合式的母選擇權相同；結構描述中的 `Chooser.call_strike` 與 `call_expiry` 是同樣那兩個欄位再來一次，會被指名拒絕。"

#: ../../trades.md:89 7bc0bd1b80734effae8ab87c2d682b78
msgid "The **put leg** control is what picks the instrument. Shared is the *simple* chooser — one strike and one expiry for both sides. Its own is the *complex* one, a different instrument and a different engine."
msgstr "**賣權腳**這個控制項決定選到哪一個商品。「共用」是*簡單*選擇者——兩邊共享一個履約價與一個到期日。「各自獨立」是*複雜*選擇者，那是另一個商品、另一個引擎。"

#: ../../trades.md:93 a33d507cd46a4f1db4ebc282a4c42c2f
msgid "Three rules come from the engines rather than the product. All three curves must count days the same way: the simple engine requires it, and the complex one assumes it without checking. The exercise must be European, and neither engine looks — an American one would price as European with the early exercise dropped. And each complex leg has to expire more than **twice** the choice date out, because the engine solves for the critical spot at (expiry − 2 × choice time) and below that asks the volatility surface for a negative time."
msgstr "有三條規則出自引擎而不是商品本身。三條曲線必須用同一種日期計算基準：簡單選擇者的引擎會要求，複雜選擇者的引擎則是假設而不檢查。履約方式必須是歐式，而兩個引擎都不看——送美式進來會被當成歐式計價，提前履約就這樣不見了。還有，複雜選擇者的每一腳到期日都必須超過選擇日的**兩倍**，因為引擎是在（到期時間 − 2 × 選擇時間）這一點解出臨界現貨價，低於這個界線就會向波動率曲面要一個負的時間。"

#: ../../trades.md:101 0d8b9676439c49dd9d1cafe6aa6c001b
msgid "**Cliquet.** A series of forward starts, each struck at a fraction of the spot when its own period opens — a ratchet. It takes a percentage strike payoff for the same reason a forward start does, plus the **reset dates**: in order, distinct, each on or after today and before the expiry."
msgstr "**棘輪式。**一連串的遠期起始選擇權，每一段都以自己那段期間開始時現貨價的某個比例定履約價——所以又叫 ratchet。它吃百分比履約價的收益函數，理由和遠期起始相同，另外還要**重設日**：依序排列、彼此相異，每一個都不早於今天且早於到期日。"

#: ../../trades.md:106 376eba4c3bae45eaa5ff3962f4036e86
msgid "**Performance** picks the engine, exactly as it does on a forward start. The ratchet pays the amount and prices analytically; the performance form pays the return of each period and is the only one with a Monte Carlo engine, so a sampled ratchet is refused rather than quietly given the wrong path pricer."
msgstr "**performance** 決定用哪一個引擎，和遠期起始上的作用完全一樣。棘輪型支付金額，走解析解；表現型支付每一段期間的報酬率，而且只有它有蒙地卡羅引擎，所以用抽樣去算棘輪型會被拒絕，而不是默默套上錯的路徑定價器。"

#: ../../trades.md:111 9524f45b672f4b23b20b04f3e651ca41
msgid "**Caps and floors are not offered**, and the reason is worth stating because it is not the usual one. The four fields exist in the schema, but `CliquetOption` never copies them to an engine — the comment in QuantLib's own source lists them and the line below it does not — so a capped cliquet would price as the uncapped ratchet and report nothing amiss. The service refuses them by name."
msgstr "**不提供上下限**，而理由值得說清楚，因為它和平常那種不一樣。這四個欄位在結構描述裡是有的，但 `CliquetOption` 從來不會把它們交給引擎——QuantLib 自己原始碼裡的註解列出了它們，下一行卻沒有做——所以一個帶上限的棘輪式會被當成沒有上限的那個計價，而且什麼都不會說。服務會指名拒絕它們。"

#: ../../trades.md:117 9c407395823a4a4aa942edcc2f1bb487
msgid "For the same reason, the gamma both closed forms publish is a placeholder `0.0` rather than a computed number, so it comes back named absent. Asking for it and getting nothing is the honest answer; getting a zero would not be."
msgstr "同樣的道理，兩個解析解引擎所發布的 gamma 是一個佔位用的 `0.0`，不是算出來的數字，所以它會被具名列為「沒有」。要了它而什麼都拿不到，是誠實的回答；拿到一個零則不是。"

#: ../../trades.md:121 aab103039c9247df861e54359b93c787
#, python-brace-format
msgid "**Vanilla.** A binary payoff on an American exercise is a one-touch and goes to the digital American engine. An American analytic price **must** name an approximation — see {doc}`engines`."
msgstr "**一般型。**美式履約上的二元收益函數是 one-touch，會走二元美式引擎。美式解析解價格**必須**指名一種近似法——見 {doc}`engines`。"

#: ../../trades.md:125 7c22796519cd4a1985e667bf8862c0a0
msgid "Payoffs"
msgstr "收益函數"

#: ../../trades.md:127 a115bc569c284ecf8aad7d399b92371c
msgid "Eight build: plain, percentage strike, asset-or-nothing, cash-or-nothing, gap, super-fund, super-share, and floating. The two binary ones select an engine rather than a formula: on a vanilla with an American exercise they give a one-touch, and on a barrier a knock digital. Floating is valid on a lookback only, which is a combination rule rather than a payoff rule, so the interface closes it elsewhere rather than the service refusing it later."
msgstr "八種可用：一般、百分比履約價、資產或零、現金或零、缺口、超級基金、超級股份，以及浮動。其中兩種二元收益函數選的是引擎而不是公式：放在美式履約的一般型上是 one-touch，放在障礙上則是敲出入二元選擇權。浮動僅在回顧式上有效，那是一條組合規則而非收益函數規則，因此介面在別處把它關掉，而不是等服務事後拒絕。"

#: ../../trades.md:137 0b9b2037e2854788ada93ed06a69e4b7
msgid "European, American and Bermudan all build. European and American carry one date; Bermudan carries every exercise date in order, the last of which is the expiry. **Payoff at expiry** is read on American and Bermudan only and has no default: with it set, the payoff is settled at expiry rather than on exercise, which changes the price rather than the convention."
msgstr "歐式、美式與百慕達式都可用。歐式與美式帶一個日期；百慕達式依序帶上每一個履約日，最後一個是到期日。**到期給付**只在美式與百慕達式上讀取，且沒有預設值：設定它之後，收益在到期日結算而非在履約當下結算，這改變的是價格而不是慣例。"

#: ../../trades.md:143 f6c6292efd2f413eaa2b63f33a96f055
msgid "The underlying"
msgstr "標的"

#: ../../trades.md:145 2728e437bdc44613861cc96f4bc62dce
msgid "Three processes build: Black-Scholes-Merton (the default), Black-Scholes and Black. Exactly one underlying — a second is an error on the underlyings field, not a silently ignored extra."
msgstr "三種隨機過程可用：Black-Scholes-Merton（預設）、Black-Scholes 與 Black。標的恰好只能一個——第二個會在標的欄位上得到錯誤，而不是被安靜忽略。"

#: ../../trades.md:149 2f542e6f16084520adb533e4f040ebfa
msgid "Black-Scholes **rejects** a dividend curve rather than ignoring it, since the whole point of that process is $q = 0$. Omitting the dividend curve on Black-Scholes-Merton means a flat zero yield, not the risk-free curve."
msgstr "Black-Scholes 會**拒絕**股利曲線而不是忽略它，因為那個過程的整個重點就是 $q = 0$。在 Black-Scholes-Merton 上省略股利曲線代表平坦的零收益率，不是無風險曲線。"

#: ../../trades.md:155 a98487cd1fe04250b3964f1915d936b0
msgid "Quanto is not a product; it wraps the *engine*. It therefore composes over any style whose engine can be built from a process alone, which is what keeps the schema free of quanto-specific messages."
msgstr "Quanto 不是一種商品，它包住的是*引擎*。因此它能疊加在任何「引擎只需一個隨機過程即可建構」的類型上，這也讓結構描述不必為 quanto 另設訊息。"

#: ../../trades.md:159 b9f5b643aadf4849a2000911a92b27c2
msgid "It needs all three of an FX risk-free curve, an FX volatility and a correlation. Under quanto an FD request takes one of the three grid presets and not an explicit size, because the wrapper constructs its inner engine from a process alone and leaves no seam for grid dimensions."
msgstr "它需要外匯無風險曲線、外匯波動率與相關係數三者齊備。在 quanto 之下，有限差分請求只能挑三個預設網格之一而不能指定尺寸，因為包裝器只用一個隨機過程建構內層引擎，沒有留下傳遞網格尺寸的縫隙。"

#: ../../trades.md:164 09e99a6680884c08a962f92d8a45c3e2
msgid "A **quanto lookback is refused by name**. QuantLib has no engine for one; this build used to price it as a plain lookback and report no error at all. The interface disables the switch so you do not spend a round trip finding out."
msgstr "**quanto 回顧式會被指名拒絕。**QuantLib 沒有對應的引擎；這個版本以前會把它當成普通回顧式計價，而且完全不報錯。介面停用該開關，免得你花一趟往返才發現。"

#: ../../trades.md:168 da7f282f0ab54b35b5a5860ef187ae19
msgid "Swaps"
msgstr "利率交換"

#: ../../trades.md:170 21fa8b3c8b1a40e5b96a0e937eb91296
msgid "A general *n*-leg swap with two leg kinds — fixed and Ibor — priced by discounting."
msgstr "一般化的 *n* 腳交換，兩種計息腳——固定與 Ibor——以折現法計價。"

#: ../../trades.md:173 47326aa2477c487ea7f220ad83746c20
msgid "**Pay or receive** is required on every leg. There is no default."
msgstr "**付或收**每一腳都必填。沒有預設值。"

#: ../../trades.md:174 ce839c379cdf4ec4a382ccaa6adea482
msgid "**The fair rate needs exactly two legs, fixed first, then Ibor.** Any other arrangement is refused rather than answered with a fair rate computed off the wrong leg."
msgstr "**公平利率需要恰好兩腳，固定腳在前、Ibor 腳在後。**其他任何排列都會被拒絕，而不是拿錯的那一腳算出一個公平利率回覆你。"

#: ../../trades.md:177 6158d053409e4475a6b3fb72398e15c3
msgid "Per-leg caps, floors, discount curve and currency are not built."
msgstr "各腳的上限、下限、折現曲線與幣別沒有實作。"

#: ../../trades.md:178 6f90c9640f61410fb92d708e765f6a2c
#, python-brace-format
msgid "A fixed leg freezes its rate at construction (see {doc}`market`)."
msgstr "固定腳在建構時凍結它的利率（見 {doc}`market`）。"

#: ../../trades.md:180 174cb8bec620472d929ee4dd33ebc46a
msgid "The worked example prices a par five-year swap to an NPV of $-0.000002$ with a fair rate of $0.027000$ — exactly the 5Y pillar its curve was stripped from, which is the whole chain agreeing with itself: bootstrap, index, fixings, both legs and discounting."
msgstr "現成範例把一筆平價的五年期交換計價到淨現值 $-0.000002$，公平利率 $0.027000$——恰好就是它的曲線所拔靴建構出來的 5Y 支點，也就是整條鏈路自我一致：拔靴建構、利率指標、定盤值、兩隻計息腳與折現。"

#~ msgid "Cliquet, digital, chooser, basket and spread are in the schema and are not built. The interface never offers them."
#~ msgstr "Cliquet、二元、選擇者、一籃子與價差選擇權存在於結構描述中，但沒有實作。介面從不提供它們。"

